  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients. Dice the chicken into bite sized pieces.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Creamy-Cajun-Chicken-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a food processor, rice the cauliflower.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Creamy-Cajun-Chicken-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "On a cutting board, dice the onion.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Creamy-Cajun-Chicken-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add in the olive oil and diced onion. Sautee for 3 - 4 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Creamy-Cajun-Chicken-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the diced chicken pieces. Cook this until all of the pieces are brown (about 6 - 9 minutes.)",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Creamy-Cajun-Chicken-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the paprika, garlic powder, onion powder, oregano, thyme, cayenne pepper, salt, and pepper. Add in the canned diced tomatoes. Let this cook for about 6 - 9 minutes covered.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Creamy-Cajun-Chicken-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the heavy whipping cream. Let cook for 5 minutes or until the chicken becomes thick.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Creamy-Cajun-Chicken-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add olive oil and the riced cauliflower. Cook for about 5 - 8 minutes. Stir in fresh parsley and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Creamy-Cajun-Chicken-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the cauliflower rice under the creamy cajun chicken. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-cajun-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54327-step-0-8",
